1
00:00:04,993 --> 00:00:12,242
The Umbrine. Ten thousand years asleep in the fire. It woke hungry.

2
00:00:12,386 --> 00:00:16,124
ODA VENN: We built her to kill a star. We never thought we'd have to.

3
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:19,017
WREN: Right. Let's go kill a sun.

4
00:00:19,883 --> 00:00:21,813
Heliobane!

5
00:00:23,709 --> 00:00:26,209
WREN: There's a little dot on my ship.

6
00:00:41,185 --> 00:00:43,445
MOTT: Welcome to the Magpie, kiddo!

7
00:00:58,391 --> 00:01:00,181
Warning. Herald approaching.
